    "body": "The initial value is set during the initialization step (same with `alpha`, `desynchronized`, and the rest). It's initialized to the value in `CanvasRenderingContext2DSettings`, which will [default to](https://whatpr.org/html/11734/canvas.html#colour-spaces-and-colour-correction) `{mode:\"standard\"}` (which is the current default behavior).",
